Home Assistant frontend
  https://github.com/home-assistant/frontend
  Typography, spacing and radius token names and values from
  src/resources/theme/typography.globals.ts and core.globals.ts; the surface,
  text, divider and state-icon colours from color/color.globals.ts; and the
  Observable10 first colour (#4269d0) used by the history chart.

Material Design Icons — Pictogrammers
  https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign
  Path data for mdi:molecule, mdi:heat-wave, mdi:thermometer and
  mdi:water-percent, inlined in the ICONS map.

The AQI category tones in public/aqi.js are original, derived from the US EPA
PM2.5 breakpoints (public domain) and re-toned to Material 3 container /
on-container levels; test.mjs asserts each pair clears WCAG AA.
